SecurityEvent
| where (NewProcessName endswith "/file" and CommandLine matches regex "(.){200,}") or (NewProcessName endswith "/ls" and CommandLine contains "-R") or NewProcessName endswith "/find" or NewProcessName endswith "/tree" or NewProcessName endswith "/findmnt" or NewProcessName endswith "/mlocate"